            "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:39:59.180334+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where this build gets strong. There's two paths. The main path (1) and the secondary path (2):\n\n1. The bully path (if you are not struggling to survive)\n2. The early sustain path (if you can't survive or are fighting a Zarya)\n\nFor 1:\nYour power should be  [Advanced Throwbotics](item_20ae3070-5e6b-4352-b024-95b426055ee0). Two javelins will give you so much bully potential. Land those javelins back to back to stun the enemy tank into a wall and they crumble.\n\nPickup [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) to raise your damage output and [Siphonic Spear](item_82c46448-08f2-4664-842c-c04d3120369a) to provide a lot of self healing. Two javelins means 20% self healing if you land both.\n\nFor 2:\nWe forgo our second spear and lean into self healing early by grabbing [Restortify](item_e5073fbb-8287-4d11-934a-1fc1c57a308b). The goal now is to be a damage sponge and get the occasional long range pick on a DPS or squishy. Pair this with  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for damage output and [Solar Regenergy](item_b03b2c68-d3e3-413a-a9b8-3385149ba9b8). This extra bit of armor regen every time you use an ability should help sustain through a Zarya beam, especially paired with [Refraction Tiles](item_16e4b34e-d8dd-4cbd-85dc-ff6370cca092) and [Restortify](item_e5073fbb-8287-4d11-934a-1fc1c57a308b).\n\nIn either build, if you can't quite afford [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a), grab [Optimized Energy](item_ec651da3-260d-4f1f-b51a-c006440955fb). Gives you decent weapon damage and will allow you to shoot longer by reducing your heat.",
