            "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:39:59.180334+00:00",
            "notes": "If you are on path 1, the bullying path, now is when you will transition into more sustain. You grab [Restortify](item_e5073fbb-8287-4d11-934a-1fc1c57a308b) now. \n\nIf you are on path 2, fighting a Zarya or are still just struggling to stay alive, you can choose to either grab your second spear with [Advanced Throwbotics](item_20ae3070-5e6b-4352-b024-95b426055ee0) or go deeper into survivability with [Hooves of Steel](item_ee26ce74-568d-47ed-8dcf-fb5cc0fbac9d). Use your best judgement here based on how the game is going. If the enemy tank is not letting your javelins land (Dva eating them, Zarya bubbles not getting blown up fast enough) forgo the second spear and go Hooves. Otherwise, the second spear at this point may give you enough bullying power to push through. \n\nWe pickup [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) now for even more sustain. You are a bully and a damage sponge at this point.\n\nOPTIONALLY:\nIf you have A+ supports and don't feel like you need much self healing, pickup [Factory Reset](item_d98df807-9dd6-4553-96bb-a1b49a0fe169). It will allow you to cycle your abilities much faster. That said, I have found [Restortify](item_e5073fbb-8287-4d11-934a-1fc1c57a308b) stlll gives me just that bit of extra sustain to win most matches.",
